                "title": "Stainless Steel Arched Mortise Entryset, Acorn KS1JI",
                "description": "Stainless Steel Arched Mortise Lockset Acorn KS1JI - This forged stainless steel handleset gives off a distinct southwestern feel that makes it perfect for traditional homes. It will grant a rustic touch that isn't too old world but still has historical notes. Each of the indents left by the hammer falls of the blacksmith that made the Stainless Steel Arched Mortise Entryset tells the story of the beautiful textures of the metal from which it was made and the artist who shaped it. The natural stainless steel finish is similar to antique nickel or pewter. It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. This ball knob mortise lockset is for 1-3/4 inches thick doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
